\paragraph{Feature complementarity.}
The full 7-feature set (F1\,=\,0.773, 10-fold stratified CV) outperforms surface-only (0.688) and reference-only (0.713; McNemar $p \approx 0$; Appendix~\ref{app:ablation-table}).
